Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, it's really\Nwhere we should be going. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's just stay with the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,While our dreams are never-ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.20,0:01:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.30,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.28,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.74,0:01:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find suspense And then commence\Nto live out another day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Open the map inside your\Nheart and see. No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our minds will never give up. There's a\Nfire in our dreams, and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way! Clear out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you had the gall to cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,for me back there—that\Nwas so embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And a lot of good it did; I ain't\Nchanged one bit—it's pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You have changed Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen you wield\Nyour Haki powers—they're
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,stronger than anything\NI've ever dreamed of,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,which really pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My pride shattered, but I'll\Nreturn your compliments!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've changed straw
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.18,0:03:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,changed Straw Hats
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.18,0:03:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Still heads here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.94,0:03:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freaking huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected an actual fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a fish to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you better get your\Nvision checked, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a sea monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A wild beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The man at the cafe said this bridge was
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,reinforced with iron to\Nprotect against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's absolutely nothing\Nto worry about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:04:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This bridge is a piece of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.62,0:04:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp should be able to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the warlord! You handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a time and place for\Nme to fight, but it's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.14,0:04:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Any?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Better get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack! Green!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Two from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to crush us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, real floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Keegan's at the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.28,0:04:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called bombgrass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.28,0:04:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work. Now keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how many of those\Nthings we're up against!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can fight them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gotta make a run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, unlock Caesar's restraints.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:04:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna help keep\Nthose fish off our backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:04:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just gonna fly away\Nand leave us for dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I suggest he reconsider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear you will all die a\Nmiserable death very soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No one abuses a brilliant\Nscientist like Caesar and lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastille!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a major power!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder the guy is\Nworth $300 million! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But seriously, Law, whenever\Nyou're ready, we can use your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When I use my powers, it saps\Naway my stamina bit by bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to conserve every bit\Nof energy for the trip back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If my strength is even the least\Nbit depleted, we're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Doflamingo we're going up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What an imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he really believe he\Nstands a chance against Joker?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The bridge collapsed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, the fog's so thick, who knows\Nhow much further we have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.78,0:06:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting fish headed straight for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we're in real trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.80,0:06:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let it destroy\Nany more of the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What stopped it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.64,0:06:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we bagged one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hurry and reel it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.46,0:06:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's the big battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to power up for it\Nwith Fighting Fish Stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose voices are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.22,0:06:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,People who live on the island, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it was uninhabited, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's on the other side of the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, how do we cross it? Get over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.35,0:06:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta scram! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.92,0:07:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly us to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Law, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear you're gonna pay for this one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.82,0:07:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, look how great the view is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have flown over like\Nthis right from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why didn't we, Caesar? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.72,0:07:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how much gas\Nenergy it takes to float three people?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought hostages were\Nsupposed to be treated humanely!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The drag marks from the\Nfish ended this spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides us, there's not\Na single person in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The waters are filling up with shipwrecks\Nfrom the fighting fish attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,so this must be green. bit gotta say the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,landscaping leaves a lot to be desired
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Joker, I'm here. Come\Nand get me. Save your.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,breath you see that beach on the southeast
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,side of the island we're gonna leave you\Nthere at three o 'clock this afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,do you guys see what i see there\Nlooks like a navy battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.66,0:08:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's not just beached;\Nit's actually stuck
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,in the island somehow\Nhow is that even possible
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:09:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the cuts on those plants\Nlook fresh it appears
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that the ship has only\Narrived on the island
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,recently its body doesn't\Nlook all that damaged
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.18,0:09:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,so they would have had\Nto survive those fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fish infested waters.\NI'm sure the Marines who
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,are on it aren't far\Naway we should be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.78,0:09:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,what do they know what\Nwe're doing here this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,changes everything damn it\Ncesar i knew i should have
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,gagged you quiet down shh shh quiet i'm a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,wanted man remember and\Nnow that my boss joker's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,officially resigned\Nfrom the seven warlords
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no authority that'll\Nprotect me if you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.94,0:09:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,me here in handcuffs\Nthen those marines are
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,sure to find me and then\Ni said be quiet if joker
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,gave up his status that\Nput him back on their
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,wanted list right i think\Nyou're hiding something
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,of course not what would\Ni do i don't control the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.94,0:10:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,navy by the way after we\Nleave here i'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,about heading over to\Ngreen bit we cannot do
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the transaction here\Nrethink this well they're
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,my enemy too look i'm\Nwith these guys come on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,where do i stand to gain\Nfrom the Straw Hats getting
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,captured if we're all on\Nthe same side why don't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you take off my handcuffs\Nwe have 15 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,here's the plan you two go hide\Nsomewhere and be prepared to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,snipe stay on guard though that\Nmay be in the forest as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you find anything, let\Nme know as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds simple enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hold on, Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't sign up for a\Nmilitary operation here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get too far ahead of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.66,0:11:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Usopp, you're really\Nmaking me feel safe. So brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, real helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.26,0:11:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dissi, don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the hurry, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.28,0:11:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna stop,\Nsay so. Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the Straw Hat? Stop! You're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you're on the island, so\Njust surrender now, right? Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got you Straw Hats
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.48,0:11:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are, but who\Nare they talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.02,0:11:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow they anticipated\Nwe'd be on this island
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the truth are you\Ngood guys or bad guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're Marines. We keep the public\Nsafe, so we're definitely good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't give you these.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a job to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of food is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,At least we still got our underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Mille Fleur.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Campo de Flores.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught one. Huh? Caught one. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a person. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.70,0:12:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's in her bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple books, some clothes. Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.12,0:12:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A transponder snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Double check for any weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Search inside her clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Point C all clear, Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Point A all clear, Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No hidden weapons at point B either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.90,0:13:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not be hasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.26,0:13:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No funny business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They've pinned my body to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll only hurt yourself if you move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I sewed you nice and snug with\Nmy magical stitch-ditch power,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,so you're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds rather handy. It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Once someone gets a taste of my trusty\Nneedle, they can't move an inch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You big people were up to\Nno good again, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'm not your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.28,0:13:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I don't even know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Leo of the Tantata tribe, a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.64,0:14:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then could you tell me where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And where's Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.44,0:14:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I mean the other big person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tall friend with\Nthe long nose, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We captured him, too, in accordance\Nwith our kingdom's rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is a country where only\Nlittle people like you live?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.87,0:14:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is known as\Nthe Tantata Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It lies beneath the great forest which\Nwe proudly made with our own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The great forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean green pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So you grow those giant plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones that cover the whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no plant, great or\Nsmall, the Tantata can't grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone watch out. Kabu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She has a strange power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She can sprout hands and arms\Nlike flowers on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've never grown hand flowers before!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds real creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.92,0:14:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it must be magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the strangest thing I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.78,0:14:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're fast, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.42,0:15:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Snatched me up before I could run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, that's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have carried me here\Nafter that gas made me pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I could probably use my power to escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and it might cause them to\Npanic and do something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So, spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come to destroy\Nour kingdom, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.18,0:15:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I grabbed your friend, but I only\Ndid so out of sheer curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.88,0:15:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter why you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Big people are not allowed to\Nsee the tantada for any reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,as the law states—you\Nmust be put to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever grudge you hold,\NI have no part of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.46,0:15:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and if you must keep your existence, a...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,a I swear I won't tell a\Nsoul we met! You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to listen to your excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, I'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:15:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.48,0:16:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that sure is a relief, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.68,0:16:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not evil after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.32,0:16:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She gets to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all it took?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You certainly are trusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take your sunglasses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Chief. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't release her. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.80,0:16:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she'll keep everything a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And why would you believe her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she means it, so it's true. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then. Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they all like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It is rather convenient, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon our stares.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not often we get to\Nsee a big person close up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.30,0:16:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The name is Gancho.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm known as the Tanta Chief, which\Nis what we call our king around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.25,0:16:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can stay as long as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:16:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to try\Nsome simmered pumpkin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.76,0:17:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so kind of you, but I'm in a\Nbit of a hurry. Hey, you! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just baked tree sap cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.90,0:17:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to taste one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're having tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.40,0:17:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I really must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got some grilled mushrooms to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.96,0:17:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but do you know where my\Ntransponder snail went? Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I released it into the wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not long until three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.50,0:17:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to contact Law quickly. The exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it? Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be leaving already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I thought you were nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you leave, then hand over\Nyour weapon before you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.76,0:17:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us a weapon or we'll\Ntake everything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I don't have one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.56,0:17:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna bleed you dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.26,0:18:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.56,0:18:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there an emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be mean to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Her partner is a great hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.64,0:18:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But where did you hear this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The big person with the long nose\Ntold me, and he said he meant it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.42,0:18:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a legendary hero\Ncome to save us at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.48,0:18:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally! Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.96,0:18:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl came just so\Nwe needed him most! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to meet him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Husab, what did you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:18:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you turn left?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:19:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Put a sock in it, Tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't concentrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.86,0:19:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, who's he talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'm in a hurry here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as much as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get there late?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.22,0:19:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take me to the flower field already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.30,0:19:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Owie, ow, ow, dang it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I really messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That human's gonna see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Run you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stupid and dumb and stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I would screw this up somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be one of\Nthose fairy things, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That are a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a toy at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Wicca and I'm from the Tonchata tribe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now please promise you won't\Ntell anyone you saw me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.72,0:20:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.22,0:20:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I must have twisted\Nmy ankle back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.02,0:20:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to take me to see my\Ncommander as quickly as possible, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.10,0:20:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, this whole thing's kind of your\Nfault when you get right down to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.74,0:20:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.50,0:20:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stole it? Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my people's job to protect\Nthe greenery of this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The big people call us fairies and give us\Ngifts in return for the hard work we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I took the sword as a present!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be scouting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.36,0:20:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My orders are to report to my commander on
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.62,0:20:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the whereabouts of the Don Quixote family!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.92,0:20:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, we're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.82,0:20:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw them honest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know for a fact they're on their way\Nto attack the Straw Hat's ship right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:20:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so we gotta hurry! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You just told this guy everything\Nyou were supposed to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.76,0:21:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're not pulling my leg, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm one of the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.34,0:21:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I really need to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, don't, don't, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrecking the whole town!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Once more, this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the Don Quixote family seriously\Ngetting ready to attack the Sunny or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you that, but\Nthey're not not going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I did it again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a transponder, Snail, so\Nthere's no way for me to warn him about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Those four, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.58,0:21:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a strong team.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm off to the sunny
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.31,0:21:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to take me back to\Nthe flower field If you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll show you the way\Nback to the sea Forget about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:21:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can find my own way back
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.90,0:21:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You can?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.00,0:22:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are you going your own way?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it. You're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.26,0:22:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.70,0:22:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.61,0:22:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,if those guys knew where to find us,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.60,0:22:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,they must have been following our\Nmovements for a while now, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.53,0:22:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've been keeping a\Npretty close eye on them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you fairies have\Na beef with Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.83,0:22:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget I told you\Nthat, okay? Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.14,0:22:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.30,0:22:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole crew's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.94,0:22:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how far is this flower field?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.58,0:22:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Go up those stairs, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I said go up the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.80,0:22:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, and I thought I was stupid. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.00,0:23:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, Mr. Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.06,0:23:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find out soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.54,0:23:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Be wary of the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a soldier, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.18,0:23:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.16,0:23:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.74,0:23:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the list of\Ncompetitors in the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.98,0:23:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you not to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.88,0:23:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.46,0:23:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.56,0:23:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'll win. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.18,0:23:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.06,0:23:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When I do, please come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.28,0:23:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want you to stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:24:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cry so easily,\Nhow do you expect to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.00,0:24:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.96,0:24:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, are you sure? She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.66,0:24:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.74,0:24:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, I don't know what's going\Non, but you shouldn't make a girl cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.50,0:24:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.76,0:24:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'm just a toy,\Nbut I must protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.36,0:24:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,These useless tin eyes of mine\Ncan't even shed a tear for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.74,0:25:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The appointed time for Caesar's handover?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.86,0:25:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.20,0:25:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Galick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.62,0:25:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You there, law? It's Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.54,0:25:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.12,0:25:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And please tell me you found the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.44,0:25:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the least of our worries now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.22,0:25:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to get out of there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.38,0:25:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.34,0:25:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Handing Caesar over is part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.38,0:25:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if Doflamingo actually\Nresigned from the seven warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.90,0:25:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As it stands,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.02,0:25:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going to be handing Caesar\Nover for absolutely nothing in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.40,0:25:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me spell it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.50,0:25:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We walked straight into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.86,0:25:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.34,0:25:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.64,0:26:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So the news about Doflamingo\Nwas some kind of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.26,0:26:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I find that hard to believe, Saka.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.64,0:26:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The public being fooled is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.00,0:26:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but the Navy HQ was also\Nduped by a false report?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.76,0:26:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, but that is the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.16,0:26:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm headed for Marie\NJoie. The five elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.36,0:26:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and I need to speak at\Nonce on this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.98,0:26:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,However, what's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.44,0:26:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You are to continue as\Nplanned and keep onward to
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.50,0:26:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar law and Doe\NFlamingo's rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.58,0:26:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that, Sokka.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.30,0:26:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All units head to the\Nsoutheast shore. Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.74,0:26:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots, there's no time left?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.16,0:26:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
